# WC2026 predictor: raw data is large and re-downloadable; the big derived
# training table is too. The small processed artefacts the dashboard needs
# (model params, fixtures, groups, Elo snapshot) ARE committed so the public
# deployment loads instantly and a push controls what it shows.
data/raw/*.csv
data/processed/training.csv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
